# Auth: o header Authorization recebe o valor CRU do token.
#   service -> SERVICE_CLIENT  (SERVICE_CLIENT_AT, default "service")
#   sdk     -> SDK_CLIENT      (SDK_CLIENT_AT, default "sdk")
# Rotas protegidas: GET /{key}, GET /sdk/{key} e DELETE /{key}.
# PATCH e GET /all não passam por Authorization no momento.

### Authentication service
POST {{host}}/auth
Authorization: service
###


### Cria/atualiza flag no project "checkout"
PATCH  {{host}}/featureflag/checkout
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: service
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "flag_name": "teste1",
  "active": true
}


### Mesma flag em outro project "billing" (isolada da anterior)
PATCH {{host}}/featureflag/billing
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: service
Cookie: {{cookie}}

{
  "flag_name": "teste1",
  "active": false,
  "strategy": {
    "percent": 50
  }
}


### Cria flag com strategy de sessão no project "checkout"
PATCH {{host}}/featureflag/checkout
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: service

{
  "flag_name": "teste99",
  "active": true,
  "strategy": {
    "session_id": ["34eec623-c9f2-494e-bf66-57a85139fd69"]
  }
}


### Lista todas as flags do project "checkout"
GET {{host}}/featureflag/checkout/all
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json


### Busca flag específica dentro do project (requer SERVICE_CLIENT)
GET {{host}}/featureflag/checkout/teste3
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: service
session_id: 34eec623-c9f2-494e-bf66-57a85139fd69


### Leitura via SDK (requer SDK_CLIENT)
GET {{host}}/featureflag/checkout/sdk/teste1
Accept: application/json
Authorization: sdk
session_id: 34eec623-c9f2-494e-bf66-57a85139fd69


### Remove flag do project (requer SERVICE_CLIENT)
DELETE {{host}}/featureflag/checkout/teste99
Accept: application/json
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: service
